    "Details": "<color=#BFBFBF>As soon as you leave the conference room, a ground crew begins hauling in the crates Marcus sent. A mixed assortment of Tribe hardware, weapons, and equipment, none of it standard production. Yang starts cataloguing the contents while Farah takes the datapackage and disappears into her workspace. After a few hours she contacts you to come see what the data has revealed.</color>",
